</svg></div><div class="lg:col-span-7"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#00B4A8"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg><span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em]" style="color:#00B4A8">Platform intelligence</span></div><h2 class="mt-5" style="color:#F5F4F0;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 3rem);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-0.035em">Powered by Victoria</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-[16px] leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(245,244,240,0.56)">Every service on this platform is backed by Victoria — Cleard&#x27;s AI engine. She answers jurisdiction questions, flags missing documents, routes correction responses, and surfaces compliance risks before they become delays. You don&#x27;t buy Victoria. She comes with Cleard.</p><div class="mt-9"><div style="background:#111310;border:1px solid rgba(245,244,240,0.12)"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-3" style="background:#0C0D0B;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(245,244,240,0.12)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#00B4A8"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg><span class="text-[11.5px] font-semibold" style="color:#F5F4F0">Ask Victoria</span><span class="ml-auto text-[9.5px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em]" style="color:#00B4A8">Online</span></div><div class="p-4 space-y-3"><div class="flex justify-end"><div class="max-w-[85%] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[12px] leading-relaxed" style="background:#171A16;color:#F5F4F0">What&#x27;s the setback requirement for a pool in Martin County?</div></div><div class="flex"><div class="max-w-[92%] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[12px] leading-relaxed" style="background:rgba(0,180,168,0.1);border-left:2px solid #00B4A8;color:#F5F4F0">Martin County requires a 7.5-ft rear setback for pool equipment and 6 ft from the water&#x27;s edge to the rear property line. Screen enclosures reduce to 5 ft with an engineered tie-down detail.<div class="mt-2.5 text-[10.5px]" style="color:rgba(245,244,240,0.56)">Cited from the county land development code · updated 11 days ago</div></div></div><div class="flex gap-2 pt-1"><span class="px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[10px]" style="border:1px solid rgba(245,244,240,0.12);color:rgba(245,244,240,0.56)">Flag missing docs</span><span class="px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[10px]" style="border:1px solid rgba(245,244,240,0.12);color:rgba(245,244,240,0.56)">Draft correction reply</span><span class="px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[10px]" style="border:1px solid rgba(245,244,240,0.12);color:rgba(245,244,240,0.56)">Check my deadlines</span></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2"><span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]" style="color:rgba(245,244,240,0.34)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-send h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#00B4A8"><path d="M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z"></path><path d="m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939"></path></svg>Permitting Administration</span><span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]" style="color:rgba(245,244,240,0.34)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-check-corner h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#00B4A8"><path d="M10.5 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.706.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v6"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="m14 20 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Private Plan Review &amp; Inspections</span><span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]" style="color:rgba(245,244,240,0.34)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#00B4A8"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Contractor License Management</span><span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]" style="color:rgba(245,244,240,0.34)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#00B4A8"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg>Insurance Compliance</span><span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px]" style="color:rgba(245,244,240,0.34)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-scale h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#00B4A8"><path d="M12 3v18"></path><path d="m19 8 3 8a5 5 0 0 1-6 0zV7"></path><path d="M3 7h1a17 17 0 0 0 8-2 17 17 0 0 0 8 2h1"></path><path d="m5 8 3 8a5 5 0 0 1-6 0zV7"></path><path d="M7 21h10"></path></svg>Lien Rights</span></div></div></div></div></section><section style="background:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E4E2DE"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 lg:px-8 py-24 md:py-32"><div class="text-center text-[10.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]" style="color:#9E9B96">Trusted by contractors across the country</div><div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-px sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6" style="background:#E4E2DE"><div class="flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-7 text-center text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]" style="background:#FFFFFF;color:#111110">GULFSTREAM BUILDERS</div><div class="flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-7 text-center text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]" style="background:#FFFFFF;color:#111110">HARBOUR RIDGE CO</div><div class="flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-7 text-center text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]" style="background:#FFFFFF;color:#111110">MERIDIAN CONSTRUCTION</div><div class="flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-7 text-center text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]" style="background:#FFFFFF;color:#111110">ATLANTIC POOLS GROUP</div><div class="flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-7 text-center text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]" style="background:#FFFFFF;color:#111110">CROSSWIND HOMES</div><div class="flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-7 text-center text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]" style="background:#FFFFFF;color:#111110">NORTHSTAR GENERAL</div></div><div class="mt-14 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><figure class="flex flex-col p-7" style="background:#F5F4F0;border:1px solid #E4E2DE"><div class="text-[28px] font-bold leading-none" style="color:#00B4A8">“</div><blockquote class="mt-4 flex-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed" style="color:#111110">We cut three weeks off every permit and stopped chasing COIs entirely. My PM got her Fridays back.</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-6 pt-5 text-[12.5px]" style="border-top:1px solid #E4E2DE;color:#6B6860"><span class="font-bold" style="color:#111110">D. Alvarez</span><br/>VP Operations · Gulfstream Builders</figcaption></figure><figure class="flex flex-col p-7" style="background:#F5F4F0;border:1px solid #E4E2DE"><div class="text-[28px] font-bold leading-none" style="color:#00B4A8">“</div><blockquote class="mt-4 flex-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed" style="color:#111110">Victoria caught a missing product approval before submittal. That single flag saved us a full review cycle.</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-6 pt-5 text-[12.5px]" style="border-top:1px solid #E4E2DE;color:#6B6860"><span class="font-bold" style="color:#111110">M. Whitfield</span><br/>Preconstruction Manager · Crosswind Homes</figcaption></figure><figure class="flex flex-col p-7" style="background:#F5F4F0;border:1px solid #E4E2DE"><div class="text-[28px] font-bold leading-none" style="color:#00B4A8">“</div><blockquote class="mt-4 flex-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed" style="color:#111110">Lien deadlines, licenses, insurance, permits — one login. We replaced four vendors with Cleard.</blockquote><figcaption class="mt-6 pt-5 text-[12.5px]" style="border-top:1px solid #E4E2DE;color:#6B6860"><span class="font-bold" style="color:#111110">R. Okafor</span><br/>Owner · Northstar General</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section style="background:#F5F4F0;border-top:1px solid #E4E2DE;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E2DE"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 lg:px-8 py-24 md:py-28"><h2 class="max-w-3xl" style="font-size:clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 2.875rem);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.035em"><span style="color:#111110;font-weight:800">One dashboard. </span><span style="color:#6B6860;font-weight:600">Every moving part.</span></h2><div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-0" style="border:1px solid #E4E2DE;background:#FFFFFF;width:fit-content"><button type="button" class="px-5 py-2.5 text-[13px]" style="background:#111110;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:600">My Permits</button><button type="button" class="px-5 py-2.5 text-[13px]" style="background:#FFFFFF;color:#6B6860">Inspections</button><button type="button" class="px-5 py-2.5 text-[13px]" style="background:#FFFFFF;color:#6B6860">License &amp; Insurance</button></div><div class="mt-8" style="animation:clFade 400ms ease-out both"><div style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E4E2DE"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-2.5" style="background:#F5F4F0;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E2DE"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="cl-dot h-2.5 w-2.5" style="background:#FF5F57"></span><span class="cl-dot h-2.5 w-2.5" style="background:#FEBC2E"></span><span class="cl-dot h-2.5 w-2.5" style="background:#28C840"></span></div><div class="flex-1 px-3 py-1 text-[11px]" style="background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E4E2DE;color:#9E9B96">app.cleard.io/my-permits</div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr] sm:grid-cols-[160px_1fr]"><div class="hidden sm:block py-3" style="background:#F5F4F0;border-right:1px solid #E4E2DE"><div class="px-4 pb-3 text-[16px] font-bold" style="color:#111110;letter-spacing:-0.03em">Cleard</div><div class="px-4 py-2 text-[12px]" style="color:#111110;font-weight:600;background:#EEECEA">My Permits</div><div class="px-4 py-2 text-[12px]" style="color:#6B6860">Inspections</div><div class="px-4 py-2 text-[12px]" style="color:#6B6860">Subcontractors</div><div class="px-4 py-2 text-[12px]" style="color:#6B6860">Licenses</div><div class="px-4 py-2 text-[12px]" style="color:#6B6860">Insurance</div><div class="px-4 py-2 text-[12px]" style="color:#6B6860">Documents</div></div><div class="min-w-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3" style="border-bottom:1px solid #E4E2DE"><span class="text-[13px] font-semibold" style="color:#111110">Active permits</span><span class="px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold" style="background:#00B4A8;color:#111110">+ New permit</span></div><div class="hidden sm:grid grid-cols-[104px_1fr_96px_100px] gap-2 px-4 py-2 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.06em]" style="color:#9E9B96;border-bottom:1px solid #E4E2DE"><span>ID</span><span>Address</span><span>Jurisdiction</span><span>Status</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:grid-cols-[104px_1fr_96px_100px] items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5" style="border-bottom:1px solid #EEECEA"><span class="text-[11px] font-semibold tabular-nums" style="color:#00B4A8">CLR-2026-0212</span><span class="hidden sm:block truncate text-[12px]" style="color:#111110">14 Pelican Bay Ln, Naples</span><span class="hidden sm:block text-[11px]" style="color:#6B6860">Collier County</span><span class="justify-self-end sm:justify-self-start"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em]" style="background:rgba(0,180,168,0.12);color:#00917F">Approved</span></span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] sm:grid-cols-[104px_1fr_96px_100px] items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5" style="border-bottom:1px solid #EEECEA"><span class="text-[11px] font-semibold tabular-nums" style="color:#00B4A8">CLR-2026-0208</span><span class="hidden sm:block truncate text-[12px]" style="color:#111110">2840 SW 48th Ct, Miami</span><span class="hidden sm:block text-[11px]" style="color:#6B6860">Miami-Dade</span><span class="justify-self-end sm:justify-self-start"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em]" style="background:rgba(220,60,60,0.1)